<title>FRANCE: French Jan industry survey shows outlook improving.</title>
<headline>French Jan industry survey shows outlook improving.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>National statistics institute INSEE gave the following seasonally adjusted data.</p>
<p>A positive figure shows the percentage points by which the percentage of respondents saying things had improved or risen outnumbered the percentage saying things had worsened.</p>
<p>					Jan   Dec  Nov  Oct  Sept Jul Jun</p>
<p> Recent past output		-4     3   -2   -8    1   -9  -9</p>
<p> Finished product stocks	 18    17   18   16   20   27  30</p>
<p> Overall orders and demand    -27   -28  -25  -25  -25  -35 -37</p>
<p> Foreign orders and demand     -4    -3   -4  -16  -18  -25 -39</p>
<p> Future output (overall)	  1   -14  -21  -23  -29  -28 -27</p>
<p> Future output (personal)	 5     4    3    3    5    3   2</p>
<p> Future prices (overall)	-13   -21  -25  -31  -26  -22 -19</p>
<p> Future prices (personal)     -22   -19  -15  -11  -14   -9 -19</p>
<p>Recent past output (breakdown)</p>
<p> Agri-food businesses	    19    25    8    9    8  -11  -7</p>
<p> Energy			     -54    -4   -7  -75   22  -11  12</p>
<p> Manufacturing output	     0     3   -2   -3   -1   -8  -8</p>
<p> Semi-finished goods	    -10    -5   -3  -15   -8  -15 -18</p>
<p> Industrial capital goods	17    11   -3    2   -6    0  -7</p>
<p> Cars and land transport	-52   -47  -44   20   39  -23  20</p>
<p> Consumer goods		     6    16   10   -2    8    6   3</p>
<p>Future output (breakdown)</p>
<p> Agri-food businesses	    -5    10    8    7   -4  -26 -12</p>
<p> Energy			     -54     2   -7   61   -3   12  -7</p>
<p> Manufacturing output	     9     5    4    1    5    3   2</p>
<p> Semi-finished goods		9     0    5    6   -3   -2   0</p>
<p> Industrial capital goods	10    15    3    6    8    7   5</p>
<p> Cars and land transport	 17    -8  -29  -30   22    7   7</p>
<p> Consumer goods		     1    -4   10   -2    4   -3   2</p>
